export class ModalCargoCtrl{static $inject=["$http","$uibModalInstance","toastService","formulario","params"];constructor($http,$uibModalInstance,_toastr,_form,_params){this.$http=$http,this.$uibModalInstance=$uibModalInstance,this._toastr=_toastr,this._form=_form,this._params=_params,this.tipoRegistro=1,this.data={}}$onInit(){this._params&&(this.tipoRegistro=2,this.data=this._params)}obtenerCodigo(){this._form.campo(this.data.descripcion)||1!==this.tipoRegistro||(this.data.codigo=this._form.obtenerTresLetras(this.data.descripcion))}saveAndUpdate(){const titulo=1===this.tipoRegistro?"Guardar":"Actualizar";if(this._form.campo(this.data.descripcion))return void this._toastr.toastr("warning","Ingrese la Descripción",titulo);if(this._form.campo(this.data.codigo))return void this._toastr.toastr("warning","Ingrese el Códgio",titulo);const URL=1===this.tipoRegistro?"/Cargo/Post":"/Cargo/Put?id="+this.data.idCargo,response=1===this.tipoRegistro?this.$http.post(URL,this.data):this.$http.put(URL,this.data);response.then(({data:response})=>{"0"!==response.id?"1"===response.id&&(this._toastr.toastr("success",response.message,response.titleSms),this.$uibModalInstance.close(response)):this._toastr.toastr("warning",response.message,response.titleSms)})}closeModal(){this.$uibModalInstance.close()}}